    plumbingNote:  'The mix of property ages in W12 means anything from original Victorian waste pipes to modern combi installations on the same street.',
    responseNote:  'W12 is well-placed for West London response.',
  },
  'fulham': {
    description:   'Fulham has some of the most expensive Victorian terraces in London, which means the plumbing inside them is often a mismatch of original pipework and expensive modern bathrooms bolted on by successive owners. The contrast between what a bathroom looks like and what is behind the tiles can be significant.',
    plumbingNote:  'High-value bathroom renovations on top of original Victorian supply pipes is a common combination in Fulham. Problems hide behind expensive finishes.',
