    responseNote:  'SE1 is one of the easiest London postcodes to reach. Central and well-connected.',
  },
  'mayfair': {
    description:   'Mayfair is almost entirely commercial at street level, with residential above. Mansion blocks, serviced apartments, and some of London\'s oldest and most valuable private houses. The plumbing in the older properties here is a mix of genuinely antique pipework and high-spec modern installations put in by wealthy owners.',
    plumbingNote:  'Older mansion blocks in Mayfair frequently have communal hot water systems serving multiple flats. Individual flat issues can trace back to building-wide infrastructure.',
    responseNote:  'W1 is central London. The easiest place to reach quickly from almost anywhere.',
